{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Stagees - Just Play !",
    "steam_appid": 3473630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stagees is currently free and in Beta, and we are keen to get feedback and development ideas from users / testers !, for more details please check out the early access section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience music in a fantastic new way ! Play any song in the world with 2-6 buttons. Choose an instrument and join your favorite band by yourself\u00a0or together with friends.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the buttons S, D, F, J, K, L in single-play to &quot;catch&quot; the notes as in a traditional rhythm game, but this time you are providing the sounds and playing side by side with your dearest artists. Correct player buttons for multi-play can be found under the FAQ section on the Stagees www homepage. For tutorials and other playing examples please watch the Stagees Youtube channel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although Stagees is a game-like music playing platform it includes some great educational elements. Go for it, challenge yourself and truly enjoy music like you never thought was possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice a bit and start to improve your personal best in single-play and be amazed how fun it is to play music  with friends using Co-op multi-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples of users who will most likely find joy in using the platform:</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who enjoy playing music games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who have a general interest in music or are involved in music somehow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to learn and understand music further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Person who might be restricted to play traditional instrument for instance due to an injury</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who like to share or gather music experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to play in a band</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who know how to make music but do not play any traditional instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to learn to make music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to get inspired to try out other music instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who have ever dreamed of becoming something in music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No previous musical background required, go ahead and Just Play !</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stagees is currently free and in Beta, and we are keen to get feedback and development ideas from users / testers !, for more details please check out the early access section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience music in a fantastic new way ! Play any song in the world with 2-6 buttons. Choose an instrument and join your favorite band by yourself\u00a0or together with friends.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the buttons S, D, F, J, K, L in single-play to &quot;catch&quot; the notes as in a traditional rhythm game, but this time you are providing the sounds and playing side by side with your dearest artists. Correct player buttons for multi-play can be found under the FAQ section on the Stagees www homepage. For tutorials and other playing examples please watch the Stagees Youtube channel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although Stagees is a game-like music playing platform it includes some great educational elements. Go for it, challenge yourself and truly enjoy music like you never thought was possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice a bit and start to improve your personal best in single-play and be amazed how fun it is to play music  with friends using Co-op multi-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples of users who will most likely find joy in using the platform:</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who enjoy playing music games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who have a general interest in music or are involved in music somehow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to learn and understand music further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Person who might be restricted to play traditional instrument for instance due to an injury</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who like to share or gather music experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to play in a band</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who know how to make music but do not play any traditional instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to learn to make music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who would like to get inspired to try out other music instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persons who have ever dreamed of becoming something in music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No previous musical background required, go ahead and Just Play !</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Stagees is an interactive music platform where the user experience will be a \u201cshort cut\u201d to music playing and gives an instant feel of being able to play the sounds for any song in the world, simply by using only a few buttons. Try out the included songs, import own songs, or check out the Store.",
